I.chatHistory.conversationDate.yesterday":"Yesterday","home.genAI.filesNotSupportedMulti":"Files aren\'t supported","home.genAI.filesNotSupportedSingle":"File isn\'t supported","home.genAI.numberFilesNotSupportedMulti":"{unsupportedNumber} files aren\'t supported","home.genAI.numberFilesNotSupportedSingle":"{unsupportedNumber} file isn\'t supported","home.genAI.err.emptyFolder":"Folder is empty. Try a different folder or files.","genAI.preparing.toast.error.all":"No files prepared","genAI.preparing.toast.error.some":"Some file(s) couldn\'t be prepared","genAI.err.renameError.characterLimit":"Collection names must be less than 100 characters.","genAI.err.renameError.invalidCharacters":"Collection names can only contain letters, numbers, spaces, underscores (_), hyphens (-), colons (:), and forward slashes (/).","genai.err.title.source.is.empty":"\\"{name}\\" is an empty file","genai.err.title.source.is.empty.n":"\\"{names}\\" are empty files","tryAI.demo.welcome.title":"Hi! This demo will introduce you to the Acrobat AI Assistant.","tryAI.demo.welcome.item1":"See a short document overview","tryAI.demo.welcome.item2":"Get quick answers to suggested questions","tryAI.demo.welcome.item3":"Ask your own questions if you sign in","tryAI.demo.document.overview":"This document provides an overview of the chocolate industry, including cacao farming trends and concerns, chocolate manufacturing developments, and anticipated trends in flavors and sales.","tryAI.demo.canned.question1":"What are this document\'s top three points?","tryAI.demo.canned.question2":"Draft an email summarizing manufacturing innovations.","tryAI.demo.canned.question3":"What were the top trending flavor combinations in 2021?","tryAI.demo.question1.relatedQues1":"Draft an email summarizing manufacturing innovations. Limit word count to 100.","tryAI.demo.question1.relatedQues2":"What were the top trending flavor combinations in 2021?","tryAI.demo.question1.relatedQues3":"What are the advantages of e-commerce for chocolate sales?","tryAI.demo.question1.answerPart1":"Based on the document, the top three points are:","tryAI.demo.question1.answerPart2":"Cacao Farming Trends and Concerns: The document highlights the evolving trends and pressing concerns within cacao farming, specifically in fair trade, promoting sustainability, equity, and resilience in the face of climate change.","tryAI.demo.question1.answerPart3":"Chocolate Manufacturing Developments: The document delves into the intricate tapestry of chocolate manufacturing developments in cacao bean farming, chocolate factories, and chocolate manufacturers.","tryAI.demo.question1.answerPart4":"Anticipated Trends in Flavors and Sales: ​The document highlights the trend towards premiumization, innovative flavors, and functional chocolates.","tryAI.demo.question1.attribution.source1":"This report delves into the evolving trends and pressing concerns within cacao farming, spotlighting initiatives aimed at fostering sustainability, equity, and resilience in the face of a changing climate.","tryAI.demo.question1.attribution.source2":"As the chocolate industry continues to evolve, driven by shifting consumer preferences and technological advancements, anticipating upcoming trends becomes paramount for stakeholders seeking to stay ahead of the curve.","tryAI.demo.question1.attribution.source3":"By staying attuned to these trends and leveraging the power of technology, creativity, and consumer engagement, chocolate manufacturers and retailers can position themselves for success in a rapidly changing marketplace.","tryAI.demo.question2.answerPart1":"Subject: Exciting Innovations in Chocolate Manufacturing","tryAI.demo.question2.answerPart2":"Dear [Recipient\'s Name],","tryAI.demo.question2.answerPart3":"I wanted to share some exciting developments in chocolate manufacturing. ​ From optimized roasting and conching techniques to the use of alternative ingredients and automation, manufacturers are embracing innovation to create high-quality chocolates. ​ These advancements ensure that they meet the evolving needs and desires of consumers.","tryAI.demo.question2.answerPart4":"If you\'d like more information, please let me know. We are thrilled about the future of chocolate manufacturing and look forward to collaborating with you. ","tryAI.demo.question2.answerPart5":"Best regards,","tryAI.demo.question2.answerPart6":"[Your Name]","tryAI.demo.question2.attribution.source1":"CHOCOLATE MANUFACTURING DEVELOPMENTS","tryAI.demo.question2.relatedQues1":"Create a presentation outline from this document.","tryAI.demo.question2.relatedQues2":"What are some challenges and opportunities in cacao farming?","tryAI.demo.question2.relatedQues3":"What are the advantages of e-commerce for chocolate sales?","tryAI.demo.question3.answerPart1":"The top trending flavor combinations in 2021 were Blueberry Dark Chocolate, Peanut Butter Milk Chocolate, and Mango.","tryAI.demo.question3.relatedQues1":"How do fair trade initiatives empower farmers?","tryAI.demo.question3.relatedQues2":"What are the challenges faced by cacao farming due to climate change?","tryAI.demo.question3.relatedQues3":"What are the critical stages in the chocolate manufacturing process?","tryAI.demo.question4":"What are the advantages of e-commerce for chocolate sales?","tryAI.demo.question4.answerPart1":"The advantages of e-commerce for chocolate sales include expanded reach, direct-to-consumer relationships, customization options, convenience, cost-effectiveness, enhanced brand visibility, and real-time analytics.","tryAI.demo.question4.relatedQues1":"What are the risks of overuse injuries and mental fatigue in pickleball?","tryAI.demo.question4.relatedQues2":"How can the psychological risks in competitive pickleball be mitigated?","tryAI.demo.question4.relatedQues3":"What factors should individuals with pre-existing health conditions consider before playing pickleball?","tryAI.demo.question5":"Are there any healthy chocolate options?","tryAI.demo.question5.answerPart1":"Yes, there are healthy chocolate options available in the market. ​ The trend of functional chocolates has led to the development of products that offer health-promoting ingredients and targeted benefits such as Antioxidants, probiotics and prebiotics, Adaptogens, Omega-3 fatty acids, and Collagen peptides.","tryAI.demo.question5.relatedQues1":"What are the physical benefits of playing pickleball?","tryAI.demo.question5.relatedQues2":"How does pickleball contribute to mental well-being?","tryAI.demo.question5.relatedQues3":"What are some comparative sports to pickleball and their global appeal?","tryAI.demo.question6":"How is social media influencing the chocolate industry?","tryAI.demo.question6.answerPart1":"Social media is influencing the chocolate industry by amplifying brand awareness, facilitating influencer marketing, promoting user-generated content, enabling real-time engagement, and driving viral trends.","tryAI.demo.question6.relatedQues1":"Create a Slack message with the key takeaway from this document","tryAI.demo.question6.relatedQues2":"Which regions are showing growing interest in pickleball?","tryAI.demo.question6.relatedQues3":"What are the potential impacts of professionalization on pickleball?","tryAI.demo.question7":"I am a chocolate startup. How can I leverage social media to further my business?","tryAI.demo.question7.answerPart1":"To leverage social media for your chocolate startup","tryAI.demo.question7.answerPart2":"Establish a strong brand presence with cohesive visuals and messaging.","tryAI.demo.question7.answerPart3":"User-generated content campaigns and contests: Encourage your customers to share their experiences with your chocolates on social media by running user-generated content campaigns and contests.","tryAI.demo.question7.answerPart4":"Collaborate with influencers to reach a wider audience and build credibility.","tryAI.demo.question7.answerPart5":"Share behind-the-scenes content to build transparency and trust.","tryAI.demo.question7.answerPart6":"Run targeted social media ads to drive traffic and sales.","tryAI.demo.question7.answerPart7":"Collaborate with other brands for joint promotions or giveaways.","tryAI.demo.question7.answerPart8":"Offer exclusive discounts and promotions to reward your followers.","tryAI.demo.question7.answerPart9":"Monitor social media for mentions and respond promptly.","tryAI.demo.question7.answerPart10":"Leverage user-generated content to showcase customer satisfaction.","tryAI.demo.question7.answerPart11":"Analyze performance and optimize your strategy based on data.","tryAI.demo.question7.attribution.source1":"Key strategies employed by chocolate brands on social media include","tryAI.demo.question7.relatedQues1":"What are the critical stages in the chocolate manufacturing process?","tryAI.demo.question7.relatedQues2":"What are the challenges faced by cacao farmers in the industry?","tryAI.demo.question7.relatedQues3":"What initiatives promote ethical sourcing and community empowerment in cacao farming?","tryAI.demo.question8":"What does fair trade mean in the context of chocolate?","tryAI.demo.question8.answerPart1":"In the context of chocolate, fair trade refers to a system that aims to promote ethical and sustainable practices in the production and trade of cocoa beans. ​ Fair trade initiatives in the chocolate industry seek to ensure that farmers receive fair compensation for their labor, promote safer working conditions, and invest in community development projects.","tryAI.demo.question8.attribution.source1":"In recent years, the concept of fair trade has gained traction within the cacao farming community, reflecting a growing awareness of the social and environmental impact of chocolate production.","tryAI.demo.question9":"What are the challenges faced by chocolate farming due to climate change? ","tryAI.demo.question9.answerPart1":"1. Rising temperatures impacting cacao tree growth and bean quality.","tryAI.demo.question9.answerPart2":"2. Shifting rainfall patterns affecting flowering, pollination, and fruit development.","tryAI.demo.question9.answerPart3":"3. Increased pest and disease outbreaks damaging cacao crops.","tryAI.demo.question9.answerPart4":"4. Water scarcity due to changes in precipitation patterns and increased evaporation rates.","tryAI.demo.question9.answerPart5":"5. Loss of biodiversity, including natural pollinators and beneficial organisms.","tryAI.demo.question9.answerPart6":"6. Vulnerability of smallholder farmers lacking resources to adapt to changing conditions.","tryAI.demo.question9.relatedQues1":"What are the factors contributing to spikeball\'s popularity?","tryAI.demo.question9.relatedQues2":"How has pickleball participation rate changed from 2013 to 2020?","tryAI.demo.question9.relatedQues3":"Which sports have emerged as notable contenders in the recreational landscape?","tryAI.demo.question10":"How are tech innovations helping farmers cope with climate change?","tryAI.demo.question10.answerPart1":"Tech innovations help farmers cope with climate change through weather monitoring, remote sensing, precision agriculture, climate modeling, mobile apps, data analytics, and early warning systems. ​ These tools provide real-time data, insights, and recommendations for informed decision-making, optimizing resource use, and adapting farming practices to changing conditions.","tryAI.demo.question11":"What kind of facilities are used to manufacture chocolate?","tryAI.demo.question11.answerPart1":"The facilities used to manufacture chocolate can range from small artisanal workshops to large-scale manufacturing plants. These facilities are equipped with specialized machinery and equipment for processes such as roasting, grinding, conching, tempering, molding, and packaging. Artisanal workshops focus on handcrafted chocolates with attention to detail, while manufacturing plants prioritize efficiency and consistency.","tryAI.demo.startQuestion":"Here are some suggestions you can try:","tryAI.demo.selectedQuestion":"Here’s your answer! <strong>Select a numbered attribution above</strong> to see source content, or ask another question.","tryAI.demo.subscribe":"Subscribe now","tryAI.demo.try.with.file":"Try with your own file","tryAI.demo.discover.items1":"Try AI Assistant on your own file","tryAI.demo.discover.items2":"Subscribe to AI Assistant for Acrobat ","tryAI.demo.discover.items3":"Ask your own question by signing in","tryAI.demo.discover.title.readyForMore":"Ready for more?","tryAI.demo.discover.title.stillWantMore":"<strong>Still want more?</strong>","genAI.monetisation.nudge.free.taste":"Upgrade by Sep 1 to continue using AI tools in Acrobat","tryAI.demo.badge":"Demo","genAI.error.filesMissing":"Some files in this collection are no longer available","multidoc.addfiles.ignoredSameFiles":"File is already in collection","multidoc.addfiles.ignoredSameFiles.n":"Some files are already in collection","multidoc.addfiles.ignoredSameFiles.n.all":"Files are already in collection","multidoc.documentRemoval.failed.message":"Unable to remove file from collection. Please try again.","tryAI.demo.title.readyForMore":"<strong>Ready for more?</strong>","tryAI.demo.tour.01.title":"Learn AI Assistant in 3 steps","tryAI.demo.tour.01.description":"Ask this document a question, get fast insights, and see how to draft an email in seconds.","tryAI.demo.tour.02.title":"Get instant document insights by selecting a prompt","tryAI.demo.tour.03.title":"AI Assistant makes it easy for you to trust its responses","tryAI.demo.tour.03.description":"Select a reference to verify the answer.","tryAI.demo.tour.04.title":"AI Assistant highlights the source content in your file","tryAI.demo.tour.04.description":"Now, you’ll learn how to ask a question about your document.","tryAI.demo.tour.05.title":"Ask AI Assistant anything, even to draft an email","tryAI.demo.tour.05.description":"Use the response to quickly create the content you need.","tryAI.demo.tour.06.title":"Ready for more insights?","tryAI.demo.tour.06.description":"Ask questions about a document of your own — or subscribe for unlimited access to AI Assistant.","tryAI.demo.tour.button.subscribe":"Subscribe","tryAI.demo.tour.button.tryYourFile":"Try with your file","tryAI.demo.tour.button.skip":"Skip","tryAI.demo.tour.button.reset":"Reset tour","tryAI.demo.tour.button.restart":"Restart tour","tryAI.demo.tour.button.starttour":"Start tour","tryAI.demo.tour.button.next":"Next","tryAI.demo.tour.button.finish":"Finish","tryAI.demo.tour.stepper":"{stepNumber} of {totalSteps}","tryAI.demo.with.a.file":"Try with a demo file","tryAI.demo.welcome.title.for.signedinUser":"Welcome to the AI Assistant demo!","tryAI.demo.welcome.item1.for.signedinUser":"Get quick answers about this demo file","tryAI.demo.welcome.item2.for.paidUser":"Try out suggested prompts and answers","tryAI.demo.welcome.item3.for.paidUser":"Ask your own questions for more insights","tryAI.demo.welcome.item2.for.freeUser":"Try out suggested prompts for free","tryAI.demo.welcome.item3.for.freeUser":"Ask your own questions by using your requests","tryAI.demo.select.prompt":"<strong>Select a prompt</strong> to get started","tryAI.demo.attribution.message":"Here\'s your response! <strong>Select a numbered attribution above</strong> to see source content, or select another prompt.","tryAI.demo.title.readyToTryOnYourOwnFiles":"<strong>Ready to try on your own files?</strong>","tryAi.demo.tryWithYourOwnFiles":"Try with your own files","tryAI.demo.message1.for.paidUser":"Get trusted insights across multiple files","tryAI.demo.message2.for.paidUser":"Generate summaries with one click","tryAI.demo.message3.for.paidUser":"Use responses to craft emails, reports, & more","tryAI.demo.message1.for.freeUser":"Try AI Assistant on your own file","tryAI.demo.message2.for.freeUser":"Subscribe to AI Assistant for full access","tryAI.demo.message3.for.freeUser":"Select a new prompt or ask your own question","tryAI.demo.message