sage":"How can I help you with this webpage?","qna.cannedQuestions.understand":"Understand","qna.cannedQuestions.analyze":"Analyze","qna.cannedQuestions.generate":"Generate","qna.cannedQuestions.understand.tooltip":"Get summaries, explanations, key highlights, and more","qna.cannedQuestions.analyze.tooltip":"Analyze this document further, assess its impact, and more ","qna.cannedQuestions.generate.tooltip":"Draft or enhance content based on this document","qna.cannedQuestions.understand.question1":"Summarize this document","qna.cannedQuestions.understand.question2":"What are the main themes of the document?","qna.cannedQuestions.understand.question3":"What conclusions does the author make?","qna.cannedQuestions.understand.question4":"Provide a brief overview of this document","qna.cannedQuestions.understand.question5":"What\'s the most important info in the document?","qna.cannedQuestions.understand.question6":"What are the main arguments?","qna.cannedQuestions.understand.question7":"Simplify this document for me","qna.cannedQuestions.understand.question8":"What are the main themes of the document?","qna.cannedQuestions.understand.question9":"Outline the main sections of the document","qna.cannedQuestions.analyze.question1":"What questions does the document answer?","qna.cannedQuestions.analyze.question2":"List potential impact to related industries","qna.cannedQuestions.analyze.question3":"Why is this information important?","qna.cannedQuestions.analyze.question4":"List examples used to support the main arguments","qna.cannedQuestions.analyze.question5":"What suggestions should I make based on this info?","qna.cannedQuestions.analyze.question6":"How is this information relevant?","qna.cannedQuestions.analyze.question7":"Why is this information important?","qna.cannedQuestions.analyze.question8":"What can I recommend based on this info?","qna.cannedQuestions.analyze.question9":"What potential assumptions does the author make?","qna.cannedQuestions.generate.question1