levant?","wp.qna.cannedQuestions.analyze.question7":"Why is this information important?","wp.qna.cannedQuestions.analyze.question8":"What can I recommend based on this info?","wp.qna.cannedQuestions.analyze.question9":"What potential assumptions does the author make?","wp.qna.cannedQuestions.generate.question1":"Summarize this in the form of an e-mail","wp.qna.cannedQuestions.generate.question2":"Brainstorm related blog post ideas","wp.qna.cannedQuestions.generate.question3":"Draft an engaging preface for this webpage","wp.qna.cannedQuestions.generate.question4":"Draft an abstract for this webpage","wp.qna.cannedQuestions.generate.question5":"Write an email with important points from this page","wp.qna.cannedQuestions.generate.question6":"Can you suggest related follow up topics?","wp.qna.cannedQuestions.generate.question7":"Create an FAQ list based on the info in this page","wp.qna.cannedQuestions.generate.question8":"Can you suggest related follow up topics?","wp.qna.cannedQuestions.generate.question9":"Brainstorm related blog post ideas","qna.input.placeholder":"Enter your own question or prompt","qna.speechToText.listening.text":"I\'m listening, ask a question","qna.speechToText.finishSpeaking.text":"Finish speaking to send","qna.speechToText.countDown.text":"Sending in {countdown}","qna.speechToText.startSpeaking.text":"Start Speaking","qna.speechToText.micPermission.header.android":"Allow microphone access","qna.speechToText.micPermission.header.iOS":"Allow microphone and speech recognition access","qna.speechToText.micPermission.notNow":"Not now","qna.speechToText.micPermission.text.android":"To ask questions using your voice, enable access to your microphone in: Settings > Privacy & Security > Microphone.","qna.speechToText.micPermission.text.iOS":"To ask questions using your voice, enable microphone and speech recognition access in: Settings > Privacy & Security.","mobile.assistant.resume.tooltip":"Get help from AI Assistant whenever you need it","mobile.assistant.resume.tooltip.time":"Short on time? {overviewLink}","mobile.assistant.resume.tooltip.overview":"Get a quick overview","mobile.assistant.resume.tooltip.unlimitedOverview":"Full access","mobile.assistant.resume.tooltip.unlimitedOverview.withDate":"Full access until {date}","bts.qna.whatsnew.label":"Study smarter with AI Assistant","bts.qna.whatsnew.title":"Meet your new study buddy: AI Assistant","bts.qna.whatsnew.description.multidoc":"Ask questions across your course materials with AI Assistant and get quick answers with trusted citations. Use the responses to create study guides, brainstorm essay topics, and more.","bts.qna.whatsnew.description":"Ask questions across your course materials with AI Assistant and get quick answers with trusted citations. Use the responses to create study guides, brainstorm essay topics, and more.","bts.multidoc.whatsnew.label":"Get answers across docs","bts.multidoc.whatsnew.title":"Get AI answers you can trust across multiple documents","bts.multidoc.whatsnew.description":"AI Assistant can answer questions across multiple course materials at once. Responses include citations that link to content right in your docs, giving you high confidence in the answers.","bts.multidoc.whatsnew.description.beta":"AI Assistant can answer questions across multiple course materials at once. Responses include citations that link to content right in your docs, giving you high confidence in the answers.","bts.label.outline":"Summarize documents","bts.outline.title":"Summarize course materials with one click","bts.outline.whatsnew.description":"Generative summary lets you create a detailed summary and outline of a textbook chapter, research report, or lecture notes. Headings help you navigate to key info fast.","badge.new.tooltip":"New","bts.qna.cannedQuestions.understand.question1":"What major insights can be drawn?","bts.qna.cannedQuestions.understand.question2":"Summarize the main sections in the document","bts.qna.cannedQuestions.understand.